  "description": "Subject: HA Node Configuration \u2013 node01 (ID\u202f7)\n\nThe high\u2011availability node named **node01** (identifier\u202f7) is currently operating in **Primary** state. Its HA properties are **ENABLED**, with HA status **ENABLED**, HA sync **ENABLED**, and the incremental check **DISABLED**. The fail\u2011safe mechanism is set to **ON**, the SSL\u20112 link reports **UP**, and the route monitor is **enabled**. Network settings place the node at IP address **192.168.1.10** on the **192.168.1.0** network with netmask **255.255.255.0**. The primary interfaces involved are **eth0, eth1, eth2** (combined list), where **eth0** is designated as the disabled interface, **eth1** as the enabled interface, and **eth2** as the monitoring (HAMON) interface. Additionally, **eth3** serves as the PF interface.\n\nOperational timings include a hello interval of **10\u202fseconds**, a dead interval of **30\u202fseconds**, and a maximum flip time limit of **300\u202fseconds**; the most recent flip completed in **120\u202fseconds**. To date the node has performed **3** flips out of a permitted maximum of **5** flips. The sync VLAN is configured to **100**, and the master status timestamp records **1623456789**. The system flags register a value of **5**.",
